            <column caption='1c. [Actual] 30D Adj Healthy QC NTV Customers - Monthly' datatype='real' name='[1b. [Actual]] Daily Average Healthy QC NTV Customers - Monthly (copy)_2837056726197620737]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='[1. [Actual]] Healthy QC NTV Customers - Monthly (copy)_2837056726197346304] * 30' />
