                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='1392' forceUpdate='true' h='3077' id='41' type-v2='text' w='92268' x='7199' y='308'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Q-Commerce OKR Overview</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='122' forceUpdate='true' h='5000' id='147' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='3385'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#eb4384' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>ⓘ</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>This tab consist of 3 sets of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>Q-Commerce</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'> metrics (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>MD OKRs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>Top OKRs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>, and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>KPIs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>) that the business would like to track in 2024. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>1. The </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>targets</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'> are only applicable for the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>monthly view</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>, and for </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>selected countries</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>2. Targets shown here reflects whatever that is entered manually by the respective POCs in a separate google spreadsheet. For more information on the targets, please reach out to calvin.ying@foodpanda.com.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>3. To deep dive on the metric on a weekly date or Month-To-Date granularity, please refer to the Weekly Overview and MTD Overview. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='57' forceUpdate='true' h='2500' id='198' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='10616'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>The following tables show the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Actuals vs Target</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> (if applicable), </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>MoM Percentage Change</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>or</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Percent Point Change in Actuals</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>, and the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Percentage </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>or</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> Percent Point Deviation from Target</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> over the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>last 6 months</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> (</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>inclusive of the current month</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>). </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>For a longer lookback period (beginning from </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Jan 23</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> onwards), use the &apos;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Date Filter</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>&apos; to filter accordingly. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='1092' forceUpdate='true' h='2538' id='103' type-v2='text' w='73333' x='533' y='13116'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Table Legend</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#8eb21b' fontsize='8'>■</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> Meets Target     </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d03c53' fontsize='8'>■</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> Below Target     </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#6b6b6b' fontsize='8'>■</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d03c53' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>No Target</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='212' forceUpdate='true' h='2538' id='105' type-v2='text' w='14666' x='84801' y='13116'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Chart Legend</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#8eb21b' fontsize='8'>■</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> Positive MoM Change    </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d03c53' fontsize='8'>■ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Negative</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d03c53' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>MoM Change</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='32' forceUpdate='true' h='1539' id='376' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='15654'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>⚠</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>QC Net GMV as % of total Platform Net GMV</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> is defined as </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>QC Net GMV / Platform Net GMV</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>,</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>selected as part of the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Country Strategy</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> It is a </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Top OKR</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> in MM, MY and TH, an </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>MD OKR</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> in BD, HK, PH, PK, SG and TW, and a </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>KPI</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> in KH. Currently, there is no target set for LA by the CIO team.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f0eae8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
