                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>⚠</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>On Time %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> is defined as </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>percentage of Orders with Delivery Time within +5 or -15 minutes of Promised Delivery Time (PDT) out of all gross orders</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>. It is a Dmart and Shops </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ed4183' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>KPI</run>
